# ccl-manifest on CuBit (SELF-002): the manifest compiler, with the full
# Ada runtime of the GCC port (userspace/ports/gcc) and the CuBit libc. It
# is the manifest step's tool when ccl-build runs on CuBit (build-params.ccl,
# CuBit's manifest_tool), installed at @system/tools/ccl-manifest.app,
# which ccl-build's launch table names. It reads the step's inputs and
# writes its outputs, all named on its argv, in the step directory: like
# the GCC port's programs it has no file scopes of its own and works in
# the places its launcher delegates (the Storehouse).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.ccl-manifest"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [(service "filesystem" "filesystem")]
  outlets => [
    (Outlet "unix.stdout" Element.Text pages => 4)
    (Outlet "unix.stderr" Element.Text pages => 4)]
  descriptors => [(Descriptor 1 "unix.stdout") (Descriptor 2 "unix.stderr")])
